   "source": [
    "# bolt.diy — Kaggle GPU Model Server Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "**Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (GGUF)** ko Kaggle T4 GPU par llama.cpp se chalata hai aur\n",
    "Cloudflare Tunnel + Worker ke through bolt.diy se connect karta hai.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Flow:** `bolt.diy` → `Cloudflare Worker (permanent URL)` → `Kaggle Tunnel (dynamic URL)` → `Model`\n",
    "\n",
    "| Cell | Kaam | Kab chalana |\n",
    "|------|------|-------------|\n",
    "| 1 | System check | Fresh session (optional) |\n",
    "| 2 | Dependencies install | Fresh session |\n",
    "| 3 | Model download (~21 GB) | Sirf pehli baar |\n",
    "| 4 | Model file verify | Download ke baad |\n",
    "| 5 | Model load (2-3 min) | Har restart |\n",
    "| 6 | Server script create | Fresh session |\n",
    "| 7 | Server + Tunnel + Worker auto-update | Har restart (band mat karna) |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Restart routine:** Cell 2 → Cell 5 → Cell 7. Model cache mein rehta hai (`/kaggle/tmp/models/`).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Cell 7 mein apni values daalna mat bhulna:**\n",
    "- `CF_ACCOUNT_ID` — dash.cloudflare.com → Workers & Pages → Overview → right sidebar\n",
    "- `CF_API_TOKEN` — My Profile → API Tokens → **Account / Workers Scripts / Edit** permission"
   ]
  },
